     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_1" loext:marker-style-name="T106"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660010" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.<text:span text:style-name="T110"> </text:span>Questions fréquemment posées<text:span text:style-name="T121"> 25</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_2" loext:marker-style-name="T107"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660011" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.1.<text:span text:style-name="T111"> </text:span>What sort of apps can I build?<text:span text:style-name="T121"> 25</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_3" loext:marker-style-name="T108"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660012" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.1.1.<text:span text:style-name="T112"> </text:span>Applications Picture Storybook<text:span text:style-name="T121"> 25</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_3" loext:marker-style-name="T108"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660013" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.1.2.<text:span text:style-name="T112"> </text:span>Une collection de livres Bloom<text:span text:style-name="T121"> 26</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_3" loext:marker-style-name="T108"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660014" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.1.3.<text:span text:style-name="T112"> Les applis </text:span>du livre de chansons<text:span text:style-name="T121"> 26</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_3" loext:marker-style-name="T108"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660015" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.1.4.<text:span text:style-name="T112"> Applis </text:span>Quiz<text:span text:style-name="T121"> 26</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_3" loext:marker-style-name="T108"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660016" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.1.5.<text:span text:style-name="T112"> </text:span>Applications hybrides (combinant différents types de ressources)<text:span text:style-name="T121"> 27</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_2" loext:marker-style-name="T107"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660017" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link"><text:soft-page-break/>4.2.<text:span text:style-name="T111"> </text:span>How can I contextualize my app for a specific audience?<text:span text:style-name="T121"> 27</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_2" loext:marker-style-name="T107"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660018" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.3.<text:span text:style-name="T111"> </text:span>How can I find the setting or feature that I need in my RAB project?<text:span text:style-name="T121"> 27</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_2" loext:marker-style-name="T107"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660019" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.4.<text:span text:style-name="T111"> </text:span>How should I choose the app package name?<text:span text:style-name="T121"> 28</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_2" loext:marker-style-name="T107"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660020" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.5.<text:span text:style-name="T111"> </text:span>How can I add audio to my app?<text:span text:style-name="T121"> 28</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_2" loext:marker-style-name="T107"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660021" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.6.<text:span text:style-name="T111"> </text:span>How can I synchronize the text and audio in my app (creating timing files)?<text:span text:style-name="T121"> 28</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_2" loext:marker-style-name="T107"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660022" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.7.<text:span text:style-name="T111"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T36">Dois-je créer un nouveau magasin de clés pour chaque application ?</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T121"> 28</text:span></text:a></text:p>
